  message: "Investigated: bakeoff-features selects first 5 entrypoints from detect_entrypoints output. The ordering favors high-confidence pattern matches (routes, controllers) which may be UI leaves rather than architectural cores. The new diversity cap (PR #2259) helps by ensuring varied entrypoint kinds. A further improvement would be to sort by in-degree within the bakeoff script, but all 4 repos now show GOOD verdicts so this is low-impact."  # 53c3
